    "commentsEn": "<ul>\r\n\t<li>On November 19, 2024, the company announced that its affiliate, Saudi Aramco Jubail Refinery Co. (SASREF), and an affiliate of Rongsheng Petrochemical, signed a development framework agreement to expand SASREF refinery.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n",
